<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Amway Asia Pacific started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Amway Asia Pacific started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it initiated coverage of Amway Asia Pacific as an outperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- In trading on the New York Stock Exchange on Tuesday, Amway Asia Pacific closed at 42-3/4.</p>
